stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: new draft from head (or restore of any old version)
    draft --> draft: autosave edits (If-Match)
    draft --> in_review: automatic checks pass + backtest attached if pricing changed
    in_review --> draft: rejected with comments
    in_review --> approved: approver is not the author (DS too if impact over threshold)
    approved --> published: tx - head unchanged since draft started, version_no assigned, effective window set, previous window closed
    published --> superseded: a newer version takes effect
    superseded --> [*]

    note right of published
        Immutable. History lists every version,
        any two can be diffed, and any one
        can be restored as a new draft.
    end note
